{"id":"vd-b1-the-unsent-letter","level":"b1","n":38,"title":{"en":"I Wish I Had Called Him","vi":"Giá mà chú đã gọi cho anh ấy"},"summary":"Cuộc điện thoại xuyên Đại Tây Dương: ông Frank tám mươi sáu tuổi nói với Mia về những điều ông hối tiếc nhất.","source":{"type":"story","id":"st-b1-the-unsent-letter","level":"b1","title":{"en":"The Unsent Letter","vi":"Lá thư chưa gửi"}},"scene":{"background":"home-day","props":[{"id":"phone","x":820}]},"cast":{"mia":{"name":{"en":"Mia","vi":"Mia"},"look":"woman","x":560,"style":{"hair":"ponytail","hairColor":"#6B4226","outfit":"cardigan","top":"#5499C7","topShade":"#4488B6"}},"frank":{"name":{"en":"Uncle Frank","vi":"Ông Frank"},"look":"grandpa","x":1180,"style":{"outfit":"apron","top":"#F4F1EA","topShade":"#E2DDD2"},"call":{"bg":"kitchen"}}},"lines":[{"speaker":"mia","en":"Mr. Mitchell? I'm Mia, Joe's granddaughter.","vi":"Ông Mitchell ạ? Cháu là Mia, cháu gái của ông Joe.","ipa":["ˈmɪstɚ","ˈmɪtʃəl","aɪm","ˈmiə","dʒoʊz","ˈɡɹænˌdɔtɚ"],"start":0.554,"end":3.464,"expression":"shy","prop":"phone","timing":[[0,0.554],[1,0.812],[2,1.621],[3,1.973],[4,2.48],[5,2.832]]},{"speaker":"frank","en":"Joe's granddaughter? I haven't heard that name for forty years.","vi":"Cháu gái của Joe ư? Bốn mươi năm nay chú không nghe thấy cái tên đó.","ipa":["dʒoʊz","ˈɡɹænˌdɔtɚ","aɪ","ˈhævənt","hɝd","ðæt","neɪm","fɔɹ","ˈfɔɹti","jɪɹz"],"start":4.254,"end":8.654,"expression":"surprised","timing":[[0,4.254],[1,4.604],[2,6.182],[3,6.404],[4,6.71],[5,7.001],[6,7.154],[7,7.543],[8,7.737],[9,8.112]]},{"speaker":"mia","en":"I'm sorry to tell you that Grandpa died last month.","vi":"Cháu rất tiếc phải báo với ông là ông cháu đã mất tháng trước.","ipa":["aɪm","ˈsɑɹi","tu","tɛl","ju","ðæt","ˈɡɹændˌpɑ","daɪd","læst","mʌnθ"],"start":9.444,"end":11.844,"expression":"sad","timing":[[0,9.444],[1,9.603],[2,9.929],[3,10.007],[4,10.255],[5,10.359],[6,10.554],[7,10.984],[8,11.322],[9,11.622]]},{"speaker":"frank","en":"Oh… I'm so sorry. I always thought there would be more time.","vi":"Ôi… Chú rất tiếc. Chú cứ luôn nghĩ vẫn còn thời gian.","ipa":["oʊ","aɪm","soʊ","ˈsɑɹi","aɪ","ˈɔlˌweɪz","θɔt","ðɛɹ","wʊd","bi","mɔɹ","taɪm"],"start":12.634,"end":18.104,"expression":"tearful","timing":[[0,12.634],[1,13.701],[2,14.076],[3,14.465],[4,15.801],[5,16.12],[6,16.551],[7,16.912],[8,17.078],[9,17.217],[10,17.328],[11,17.578]]},{"speaker":"mia","en":"I found a letter he wrote to you in 1985. He never sent it.","vi":"Cháu tìm thấy một lá thư ông viết cho ông năm 1985. Ông chưa bao giờ gửi.","ipa":["aɪ","faʊnd","ə","ˈlɛtɚ","hi","ɹoʊt","tu","ju","ɪn","","hi","ˈnɛvɚ","sɛnt","ɪt"],"start":18.894,"end":23.074,"expression":"sad","timing":[[0,18.894],[1,19.024],[2,19.285],[3,19.363],[4,19.702],[5,19.884],[6,20.105],[7,20.222],[8,20.327],[10,22.021],[11,22.269],[12,22.568],[13,22.842]]},{"speaker":"frank","en":"What did it say?","vi":"Trong thư viết gì?","ipa":["wʌt","dɪd","ɪt","seɪ"],"start":23.864,"end":24.914,"expression":"worried","timing":[[0,23.864],[1,24.053],[2,24.206],[3,24.345]]},{"speaker":"mia","en":"He said he was wrong, and he asked you to forgive him.","vi":"Ông viết là ông đã sai, và ông xin ông tha thứ.","ipa":["hi","sɛd","hi","wɑz","ɹɔŋ","ənd","hi","æskt","ju","tu","fɚˈɡɪv","hɪm"],"start":25.704,"end":28.584,"expression":"sad","timing":[[0,25.704],[1,25.765],[2,26.026],[3,26.169],[4,26.351],[5,27.015],[6,27.146],[7,27.315],[8,27.666],[9,27.771],[10,27.875],[11,28.239]]},{"speaker":"frank","en":"He said that? Oh, Joe. I wish I had known.","vi":"Anh ấy nói vậy sao? Ôi, Joe. Giá mà chú biết.","ipa":["hi","sɛd","ðæt","oʊ","dʒoʊ","aɪ","wɪʃ","aɪ","hæd","noʊn"],"start":29.374,"end":33.744,"expression":"tearful","timing":[[0,29.374],[1,29.482],[2,29.815],[3,30.907],[4,31.212],[5,32.465],[6,32.66],[7,32.951],[8,33.076],[9,33.271]]},{"speaker":"mia","en":"He said he regretted the argument every day.","vi":"Ông nói ông hối hận về cuộc cãi vã đó mỗi ngày.","ipa":["hi","sɛd","hi","ɹɪˈɡɹɛtɪd","ðə","ˈɑɹɡjəmənt","ˈɛvɚi","deɪ"],"start":34.534,"end":37.034,"expression":"sad","timing":[[0,34.534],[1,34.595],[2,34.869],[3,35.025],[4,35.533],[5,35.65],[6,36.301],[7,36.575]]},{"speaker":"frank","en":"So did I. I shouldn't have said the things I said.","vi":"Chú cũng vậy. Lẽ ra chú không nên nói những lời như thế.","ipa":["soʊ","dɪd","aɪ","aɪ","ˈʃʊdənt","hæv","sɛd","ðə","θɪŋz","aɪ","sɛd"],"start":37.824,"end":41.474,"expression":"sad","timing":[[0,37.824],[1,38.025],[2,38.345],[3,39.464],[4,39.658],[5,39.978],[6,40.103],[7,40.422],[8,40.52],[9,40.895],[10,41.033]]},{"speaker":"mia","en":"What happened between you?","vi":"Chuyện gì đã xảy ra giữa hai ông?","ipa":["wʌt","ˈhæpənd","bɪˈtwin","ju"],"start":42.264,"end":43.454,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,42.264],[1,42.365],[2,42.73],[3,43.082]]},{"speaker":"frank","en":"It doesn't matter now. It was about money and the shop. Such a stupid reason.","vi":"Giờ thì chẳng còn quan trọng. Chuyện tiền bạc và cửa hàng. Một lý do thật ngớ ngẩn.","ipa":["ɪt","ˈdʌzənt","ˈmætɚ","naʊ","ɪt","wɑz","əˈbaʊt","ˈmʌni","ənd","ðə","ʃɑp","sʌtʃ","ə","ˈstupəd","ˈɹizən"],"start":44.244,"end":50.524,"expression":"sad","timing":[[0,44.244],[1,44.382],[2,44.798],[3,45.201],[4,46.362],[5,46.529],[6,46.682],[7,47.085],[8,47.473],[9,47.64],[10,47.723],[11,48.99],[12,49.365],[13,49.49],[14,49.976]]},{"speaker":"mia","en":"Did you ever try to contact him?","vi":"Ông có bao giờ thử liên lạc với ông cháu không?","ipa":["dɪd","ju","ˈɛvɚ","tɹaɪ","tu","ˈkɑnˌtækt","hɪm"],"start":51.314,"end":52.814,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,51.314],[1,51.405],[2,51.496],[3,51.731],[4,51.952],[5,52.056],[6,52.538]]},{"speaker":"frank","en":"I wrote three letters, but I never had the courage to send them. We were both too proud.","vi":"Chú viết ba lá thư, nhưng chưa bao giờ đủ can đảm gửi đi. Cả hai anh em đều quá kiêu hãnh.","ipa":["aɪ","ɹoʊt","θɹi","ˈlɛtɚz","bʌt","aɪ","ˈnɛvɚ","hæd","ðə","ˈkɝədʒ","tu","sɛnd","ðɛm","wi","wɝ","boʊθ","tu","pɹaʊd"],"start":53.604,"end":59.634,"expression":"sad","timing":[[0,53.604],[1,53.736],[2,54.069],[3,54.361],[4,55.319],[5,55.527],[6,55.625],[7,56.041],[8,56.222],[9,56.333],[10,56.819],[11,56.916],[12,57.25],[13,58.23],[14,58.411],[15,58.619],[16,58.938],[17,59.133]]},{"speaker":"mia","en":"That's so sad. You both wanted the same thing.","vi":"Buồn quá. Cả hai ông đều mong cùng một điều.","ipa":["ðæts","soʊ","sæd","ju","boʊθ","ˈwɔntɪd","ðə","seɪm","θɪŋ"],"start":60.424,"end":63.474,"expression":"tearful","timing":[[0,60.424],[1,60.633],[2,60.88],[3,61.78],[4,62.015],[5,62.34],[6,62.64],[7,62.731],[8,63.056]]},{"speaker":"frank","en":"If only I had picked up the phone. Just once. I should have called him.","vi":"Giá mà chú nhấc điện thoại lên. Chỉ một lần thôi. Lẽ ra chú nên gọi cho anh ấy.","ipa":["ɪf","ˈoʊnli","aɪ","hæd","pɪkt","ʌp","ðə","foʊn","dʒʌst","wʌns","aɪ","ʃʊd","hæv","kɔld","hɪm"],"start":64.264,"end":69.934,"expression":"tearful","timing":[[0,64.264],[1,64.43],[2,64.846],[3,64.999],[4,65.18],[5,65.527],[6,65.707],[7,65.832],[8,67.077],[9,67.424],[10,68.718],[11,68.927],[12,69.149],[13,69.288],[14,69.635]]},{"speaker":"mia","en":"It's too late for Grandpa. But it isn't too late for our families.","vi":"Đã quá muộn với ông cháu. Nhưng chưa quá muộn với gia đình mình.","ipa":["ɪts","tu","leɪt","fɔɹ","ˈɡɹændˌpɑ","bʌt","ɪt","ˈɪzənt","tu","leɪt","fɔɹ","ˈaʊɚ","ˈfæməliz"],"start":70.724,"end":74.454,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,70.724],[1,70.904],[2,71.099],[3,71.32],[4,71.45],[5,72.312],[6,72.768],[7,72.872],[8,73.119],[9,73.262],[10,73.484],[11,73.64],[12,73.77]]},{"speaker":"frank","en":"You're right, my dear. It's never too late to start again. Will you come and visit?","vi":"Cháu nói đúng. Chẳng bao giờ là quá muộn để bắt đầu lại. Cháu sẽ sang thăm chú chứ?","ipa":["jʊɹ","ɹaɪt","maɪ","dɪɹ","ɪts","ˈnɛvɚ","tu","leɪt","tu","stɑɹt","əˈɡɛn","wɪl","ju","kʌm","ənd","ˈvɪzɪt"],"start":75.244,"end":81.384,"expression":"happy","react":{"mia":"happy"},"timing":[[0,75.244],[1,75.382],[2,75.729],[3,75.965],[4,77.196],[5,77.487],[6,77.918],[7,78.237],[8,78.529],[9,78.654],[10,79.015],[11,80.198],[12,80.393],[13,80.56],[14,80.81],[15,80.935]]}],"words":[{"id":"regret","en":"regret","ipa":"ɹəˈɡɹɛt","vi":"hối tiếc; lấy làm tiếc; sự nuối tiếc","level":1},{"id":"proud","en":"proud","ipa":"pɹaʊd","vi":"tự hào; hãnh diện; kiêu ngạo","level":2},{"id":"forgive","en":"forgive","ipa":"fɚˈɡɪv","vi":"tha thứ; bỏ qua; xóa nợ","level":2},{"id":"argument","en":"argument","ipa":"ˈɑɹɡjəmənt","vi":"cuộc tranh cãi; lập luận","level":1},{"id":"wish","en":"wish","ipa":"wɪʃ","vi":"ước; mong; điều ước","level":0},{"id":"courage","en":"courage","ipa":"ˈkɝədʒ","vi":"lòng can đảm; sự dũng cảm","level":2}],"focus":{"title":"Bày tỏ sự hối tiếc","pattern":"I wish I had… · If only I had… · I should have… · I shouldn't have… · It's too late now. · It's never too late to…","explain":"Hối tiếc về quá khứ: \"I wish I had + quá khứ phân từ\" (giá mà tôi đã…), \"If only I had…\". Tự trách: \"I should have called him.\" / \"I shouldn't have said that.\" An ủi: \"It's never too late to…\".","keys":["i wish i had","if only i had","i should have","i shouldn't have","too late","never too late"],"lines":[7,9,15,16,17]},"audio":{"src":"/audio/library/videos/vd-b1-the-unsent-letter.mp3","v":"1216a708e2","duration":82.488,"fps":25,"mouth":""}}